<%--
_Apidocs_Section - one of the application's own sections, as its own page in the console.

The application hands Rsx_Api_Docs::page() a title and Markdown; the server renders the
Markdown through Markdown_Rendition::render() (raw HTML discarded, an element allowlist on
the output) before it is baked into the page, so section.html is placed unescaped here and
nothing else on this page is.

$section - {slug, title, html} from _Apidocs_Catalog.find_section()
--%>
<Define:_Apidocs_Section tag="article">
<% const section = this.args.section; %>
<h1 class="_Apidocs_Section__title"><%= section.title %></h1>
<div class="_Apidocs_Section__body"><%!= section.html %></div>
</Define:_Apidocs_Section>
